{"id":"prepositions-0169","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 169","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"after","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Could you look ___ my plants while I\u0027m away?","hint":"look ___ = take care of","explanation":"look AFTER somebody/something = take care of them."},{"answer":"about","accept":["about"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I\u0027m a bit anxious ___ the results.","hint":"anxious ___ sth (worried)","explanation":"anxious ABOUT something = worried about it."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Critics attacked the film ___ its slow pace.","hint":"criticise sth ___ sth","explanation":"criticise/criticize something FOR a reason."},{"answer":"on","accept":["upon"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Our picnic depends ___ the weather.","hint":"depend ___","explanation":"depend ON (upon in formal style)."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The committee does not approve ___ the changes.","hint":"approve ___ sth (verb)","explanation":"Verb: approve OF something (noun \u0027approval\u0027 has no preposition)."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s keen ___ joining the photography club.","hint":"keen ___ sth/doing","explanation":"keen ON something/doing something."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Several parents objected ___ the new timetable.","hint":"object ___ sth","explanation":"object TO something."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She apologised ___ being so late.","hint":"apologise ___ sth","explanation":"apologise FOR something/doing something."}]}